#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:1
msgid "Recipe reference"
msgstr "配方参考"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:3
msgid ""
"Recipes are YAML files for repeatable quantization settings. They keep "
"method, bit width, strategy, selectors, calibration inputs, and output "
"behavior together for review and reruns."
msgstr "配方是用于可重复量化设置的 YAML 文件。它们将方法、位宽、策略、选择器、校准输入和输出行为集中在一起，便于审查和重新运行。"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:5
msgid ""
"Version 1 recipes also support per-selector MSE policies. Use a per-"
"selector entry when different parts of one checkpoint need different "
"weight formats or activation policies."
msgstr "版本 1 配方还支持逐选择器 MSE 策略。当同一检查点的不同部分需要不同权重格式或激活策略时，请使用逐选择器条目。"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:7
msgid "Recipe versions"
msgstr "配方版本"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:9
msgid ""
"`version: 1` is the original checkpoint-only MSE schema. `version: 2` is "
"the extended schema for calibrated methods, nested calibration settings, "
"method-specific mappings, and output-format settings. If `version` is "
"omitted, the loader uses version 1. Version 1 rejects version-2-only keys"
" such as `format`, `calibration`, `gptq`, `awq`, and `autoround`."
msgstr "`version： 1` is the 原始 检查点-仅 MSE schema。 `version： 2` is the extended schema for calibrated methods， nested 校准 settings， 方法-specific mappings， and 输出-format settings。 If `version` is omitted， the loader 使用 version 1。 Version 1 rejects version-2-仅 keys such as `format`， `calibration`， `gptq`， `awq`， and `autoround`。"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:11
msgid ""
"Use version 1 for checkpoint-only MSE recipes. Use version 2 for GPTQ, "
"AWQ, AutoRound, nested calibration, or explicit output ABI settings."
msgstr "Use version 1 for 检查点-仅 MSE recipes。 Use version 2 for GPTQ， AWQ， AutoRound， nested 校准， or 显式 输出 ABI settings。"

