#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:78
msgid "Selector fields"
msgstr "选择器字段"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:80
msgid ""
"Recipe selectors accept either a built-in selector string or an exact "
"mapping with one `name` key:"
msgstr "配方 selectors accept either a built-in 选择器 string or an exact mapping with one `name` key："

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:90
msgid ""
"The mapping form is the recipe equivalent of the CLI `--select-name` and "
"`--exclude-name` options. The CLI `--select` and `--exclude` options "
"accept only built-in selector names. Recipe and CLI selectors are merged "
"as a union before exclusions are applied. Regex patterns match checkpoint"
" weight names."
msgstr "The mapping 形式 is the 配方 equivalent of the CLI `--select-name` and `--exclude-name` 选项。 The CLI `--select` and `--exclude` 选项 accept 仅 built-in 选择器 名称。 配方 and CLI selectors are merged as a 并集 before 排除项 are 应用。 正则表达式 patterns match 检查点 权重 名称。"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:92
msgid ""
"Do not use a regex to split a fused inference unit. A fused attention "
"pair or fused expert bank must be selected as a complete unit. A routed "
"expert bank must include every selected expert and its complete gate, up,"
" and down projection set."
msgstr "Do not use a 正则表达式 to 划分 a fused 推理 unit。 A fused 注意力 pair or fused expert bank 必须 be 选中的 as a 完整 unit。 A routed expert bank 必须 包含 every 选中的 expert and its 完整 gate， up， and down projection set。"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:94
msgid "Per-selector fields"
msgstr "逐选择器字段"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:96
msgid ""
"Per-selector entries use exactly one `target` built-in selector or `name`"
" regex, plus an explicit `weight_format`, `activation_bits`, and "
"`strategy`:"
msgstr "Per-选择器 entries use exactly one `target` built-in 选择器 or `name` 正则表达式， plus an 显式 `weight_format`， `activation_bits`， and `strategy`："

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:118
msgid ""
"Per-selector entries may use `group_size`, `chunk_size`, and W8A8 "
"`scale_dtype`. The supported `weight_format` values are `int4` and "
"`int8`. Rules are evaluated in order and the last matching rule wins. CLI"
" rules follow recipe rules, and CLI `--select-name` rules follow CLI "
"`--select` rules. Global exclusions are applied after local rules."
msgstr "Per-选择器 entries may use `group_size`， `chunk_size`， and W8A8 `scale_dtype`。 The supported `weight_format` 值 are `int4` and `int8`。 Rules are evaluated in 顺序 and the last 匹配的 rule wins。 CLI rules follow 配方 rules， and CLI `--select-name` rules follow CLI `--select` rules。 Global 排除项 are 应用 after 本地 rules。"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:120
msgid ""
"Per-selector mode supports MSE W4A16, W8A16, and W8A8. Do not combine "
"per-selector entries with the top-level global `bits`, `activation_bits`,"
" `scale_dtype`, `strategy`, `group_size`, or `chunk_size` settings for "
"the same policy. The legacy homogeneous recipe form remains available."
msgstr "Per-选择器 mode 支持 MSE W4A16， W8A16， and W8A8。 Do not combine per-选择器 entries with the top-level global `bits`， `activation_bits`， `scale_dtype`， `strategy`， `group_size`， or `chunk_size` settings for the same 策略。 The 旧版 homogeneous 配方 形式 remains available。"

