"The corresponding CLI options are `--calibration-data`, `--calibration-"
"samples`, `--calibration-seq-length`, `--calibration-seed`, "
"`--calibration-split`, `--calibration-text-column`, and `--trust-remote-"
"code`. See [calibration](../how-to/calibrate-models.md) for accepted file"
" shapes and routing coverage requirements."
msgstr "The corresponding CLI 选项 are `--calibration-data`， `--calibration-samples`， `--calibration-seq-length`， `--calibration-seed`， `--calibration-split`， `--calibration-text-column`， and `--trust-remote-code`。 See [calibration](../how-to/calibrate-models.md) for 接受的 file 形状 and routing coverage requirements。"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:138
msgid "Method mappings"
msgstr "方法映射"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:140
msgid "Version 2 can contain these mappings:"
msgstr "版本 2 可以包含以下映射："

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:169
msgid ""
"`official_config` imports an official AutoRound JSON configuration at "
"lower priority. The bridge recognizes `scheme`, `bits`, `group_size`, "
"`iters`, `nsamples`, `seqlen`, and both `enable_quantized_input` and the "
"historical `enable_quanted_input` spelling. Explicit CLI values override "
"recipe values. Recipe values override imported values. Built-in policy "
"defaults fill remaining fields. The output retains AutoRound algorithm "
"provenance even though its tensor ABI is GPTQ-compatible and identifies "
"`flagos-compressor` as the provider. Ready-made recipes are available "
"under `examples/recipes/`."
msgstr "`official_config` imports an 官方 AutoRound JSON 配置 at lower priority。 The bridge 识别 `scheme`， `bits`， `group_size`， `iters`， `nsamples`， `seqlen`， and both `enable_quantized_input` and the historical `enable_quanted_input` spelling。 显式 CLI 值 override 配方 值。 配方 值 override imported 值。 Built-in 策略 defaults fill remaining fields。 The 输出 retains AutoRound 算法 来源 even though its tensor ABI is GPTQ-兼容 and identifies `flagos-compressor` as the provider。 Ready-made recipes are available under `examples/recipes/`。"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:171
msgid "Unselected weights"
msgstr "未选中权重"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:173
msgid "The currently executable unselected-weight policy is:"
msgstr "The 当前 executable unselected-权重 策略 is："

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:181
msgid ""
"This policy converts unselected source MXFP4 or block FP8 weights to "
"BF16. Unselected ordinary floating-point weights remain unchanged."
msgstr "This 策略 converts unselected 源 MXFP4 or 块 FP8 权重 to BF16。 Unselected 普通 floating-point 权重 remain unchanged。"

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:183
msgid "Do not use this as a current workflow:"
msgstr "Do not use this as a current 工作流："

#: ../../source/reference/recipes.md:190
msgid ""
"The policy parser accepts `preserve` as a policy shape, but the planner "
"rejects it because preserving a source low-precision format requires a "
"compatible runtime configuration and inference kernel. `preserve` is "
"therefore not an executable output policy in the current implementation. "
"`convert` requires `format: bf16`."
msgstr "The 策略 parser accepts `preserve` as a 策略 形状， but the planner rejects it because preserving a 源 low-precision format 需要 a 兼容 运行时 配置 and 推理 kernel。 `preserve` is therefore not an executable 输出 策略 in the current implementation。 `convert` 需要 `format： bf16`。"

